            "value" : "饮品定制动画示例，带口味 / 杯型选择和杯子动画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated floating capsule labels over an image. Labels fade in/out at specified positions, ideal for feature callouts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "悬浮在图片上的胶囊标签动画，在指定位置淡入淡出，适合标注功能亮点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated liquid chrome surface — three sequential value-noise samples domain-warp into a fluid metallic flow lit with a gamma curve and a high-power specular glint. Shadow / silver / highlight / tint colors are tunable; the cool spec bias is baked in for true chrome feel. Tap the gear to live-tune." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "动态液态金属表面：三次连续的值噪声采样做域扭曲，形成流动的金属质感，配合伽马曲线光照和高强度镜面高光。阴影 / 银色 / 高光 / 色调颜色均可调，内置冷色高光偏置，呈现真实的铬金属质感。点齿轮可实时调节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated Loop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "动画环"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated Loop Controls" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "动画环控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated radar (spider) chart with axis labels, grid rings, and radial lines. Supports 3+ axes with customizable max value." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "带动画的雷达（蛛网）图，含坐标轴标签、网格环和放射线，支持 3 个以上的轴，最大值可自定义。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animated three-dot bouncing indicator for chat typing states. Configurable dot size, color, and spacing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聊天“正在输入”的三点跳动指示器，点的大小、颜色和间距可配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Animation" : {
