          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Canvas-rendered rotating 3D dot sphere — N dots distributed via spherical Fibonacci / Vogel spiral, optional morph between random 3D cloud and even sphere, one-axis perspective projection, palette cross-fade waves up the sphere. Tap the gear to tune palette, dot count / size, morph, rotation, and fade timing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Canvas 渲染的旋转 3D 点阵球：N 个点按球面斐波那契 / Vogel 螺旋分布，可在随机 3D 点云与均匀球面之间变形，单轴透视投影，配色沿球面自下而上渐变过渡。点齿轮可调节配色、点数 / 点大小、变形、旋转和渐变节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Canvas-rendered rotating 3D glyph sphere — any text (1 char tiles, multi-char rotates) drawn at each spherical Fibonacci point with perspective-scaled font, back-face culling, palette cross-fade waves up the sphere. Tap the gear to edit text, weight, glyph count, font size, palette, morph, rotation, and fade." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Canvas 渲染的旋转 3D 文字球：任意文字（单字平铺，多字轮换）绘制在每个球面斐波那契点上，字号随透视缩放，背面剔除，配色沿球面自下而上渐变过渡。点齿轮可编辑文字、字重、字数、字号、配色、变形、旋转和渐变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capsule status badge with five semantic styles (info, success, warning, error, neutral). LocalizedStringKey and String overloads." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
