        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "展示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Domain-warped FBM smoke field — drops of ink diffusing through water. Two-stage warp on 5-octave value noise blends four ink colors plus a wispy glow highlight. Heavier per-pixel cost than Fractal Clouds. Tap the gear to live-tune." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "域扭曲的 FBM 烟雾场，像墨滴在水中扩散。在 5 层八度值噪声上做两级扭曲，混合四种墨色，外加缕缕辉光高光。单像素开销比分形云更高。点齿轮可实时调节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't have an account? Sign Up" : {
