      }
    },
    "Dot-orbit procedural background — Voronoi-cell dots orbiting around their cell centers + rotating individually, mapped onto a 1–10 step-discretized color ramp. Tap the gear to tune palette, dot size / range, orbit spreading, palette steps, and motion." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "环绕点阵程序化背景：Voronoi 单元中的圆点绕各自中心公转并自转，映射到 1–10 级离散色阶。点齿轮可调节配色、点大小 / 范围、轨道扩散、色阶数和运动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dots" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点阵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dots Controls" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点阵控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a glass orb filled with its own flowing color gradient — the sphere magnifies and bends its gradient with a spherical barrel warp, ringed by a cool Fresnel rim, an upper-left specular hot-spot, and faint edge RGB dispersion so it reads as a solid glass ball. Adapted from Inferno's Warping Loupe by Paul Hudson (MIT). Tap the gear to live-tune radius, magnification, refraction, edge highlight, dispersion, and color flow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动一颗内含流动渐变的玻璃球：球体用球面桶形畸变放大并弯曲内部渐变，外圈是冷色菲涅尔边缘，左上方有镜面高光，边缘带淡淡的 RGB 色散，看起来像一颗实心玻璃球。改编自 Paul Hudson 的 Inferno「Warping Loupe」（MIT）。点齿轮可实时调节半径、放大倍数、折射、边缘高光、色散和色彩流动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag the card to tilt its holographic finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动卡片，倾斜查看全息效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draggable image comparison slider with auto-oscillating animation. Supports custom labels, speed, and aspect ratio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可拖动的图片对比滑块，带自动来回摆动动画，支持自定义标签、速度和宽高比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drifting cumulus-like clouds built from a two-pass 5-octave FBM noise — the first pass warps the second's sample position for soft swirls. Sky / cloud / warm-tint colors, drift velocity, coverage, and warp depth are all tunable. Tap the gear to live-tune." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由两轮 5 层八度 FBM 噪声生成的飘动积云：第一轮扭曲第二轮的采样位置，形成柔和的漩涡。天空 / 云 / 暖色调颜色、漂移速度、覆盖率和扭曲深度均可调。点齿轮可实时调节。"
          }
        }
