    "Lay a sheet of refractive glass over any content inside an analytic SDF region (circle or rounded rectangle). The rim bends the background hardest while the centre stays calm, a golden-angle disk frosts the content, the same taps split chromatically for dispersion, and tint, directional edge light, a 3D specular glint and a Fresnel rim finish it off. Tap the gear to live-tune Shape / Glass / Highlight / Fresnel / Tint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在任意内容上覆盖一层折射玻璃，作用区域为解析式 SDF（圆形或圆角矩形）。边缘对背景的弯折最强，中心保持平稳；黄金角圆盘采样让内容呈磨砂感，同一组采样按通道分离产生色散；再加上色调、定向边缘光、3D 镜面高光和菲涅尔边缘。点齿轮可实时调节形状 / 玻璃 / 高光 / 菲涅尔 / 色调。"
          }
