    "Multi-layer twinkling starfield rendered via a Metal stitchable shader. Per-cell hash places stars, parallax layers drift downward at different speeds, and a sin-driven term twinkles each star. Tap the gear in this preview to live-tune layers, density, star size, twinkle, and colors." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 Metal stitchable 着色器渲染的多层闪烁星空：按单元哈希放置星星，视差层以不同速度向下漂移，正弦项让每颗星闪烁。点此预览中的齿轮可实时调节层数、密度、星星大小、闪烁和颜色。"
          }
        }
