    "Pulsing concentric rings in four hand-tuned styles — Shape (5 geometric shapes: circle/square/diamond/hexagon/star), Diamond (L1 distance), Neon (circle + angular wobble), Warp (stretched ellipse). Three RGB channels phase-offset for chromatic-aberration sweep. Tap the gear to switch style and live-tune." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "四种精调风格的脉动同心环：Shape（圆 / 方 / 菱形 / 六边形 / 星形 5 种几何形状）、Diamond（L1 距离）、Neon（圆形 + 角向抖动）、Warp（拉伸椭圆）。三个 RGB 通道相位错开，形成色差扫掠。点齿轮可切换风格并实时调节。"
