          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SmileMax - Glow Up Coach" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Smoke Ring" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烟圈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smoke Ring Controls" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烟圈控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smoke-ring procedural background — polar-coordinate ring distorted by two phase-shifted FBM noise layers that cross-fade so the smoke never visibly loops. 1–10 color gradient + tunable radius / thickness / inner fill / noise iterations. Tap the gear to live-tune." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烟圈程序化背景：极坐标圆环被两层相位错开的 FBM 噪声扭曲，两层交替淡入淡出，让烟雾看不出循环。1–10 色渐变，半径 / 厚度 / 内部填充 / 噪声迭代次数可调。点齿轮可实时调节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "柔和"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft tri-color noise gradient with film grain — the 2025-era staple hero background (Apple Music posters, Spotify cards, Linear gradients). Two low-frequency noise samples blend three colors; a per-frame high-frequency hash adds the film grain. Tap the gear to live-tune." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "带胶片颗粒的柔和三色噪声渐变，2025 年前后流行的头图背景（Apple Music 海报、Spotify 卡片、Linear 渐变）。两次低频噪声采样混合三种颜色，每帧的高频哈希加上胶片颗粒。点齿轮可实时调节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
